title: mf metarecord field rename
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Data model]]
kind: reference
summary: Rename the field: every value moves

Moves every value of the field to the new name, `nothing` rows included; refused when the metarecord already has a field of that name — over a query, on every match having it, the whole write refused when one already has it ([[Editing metarecords from the command line]]).
